---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Nitron & Penske Suspension Systems | Specialist Engineering | Too Fast To Race" description="Bespoke Nitron and Penske suspension systems alongside specialist motorsport engineering products including Kawasaki Ninja H2 dry sump systems. Consultation-led specification for fast road, track day and race applications.">
  
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="stripe-accent"></span>
      <h1>Nitron & Penske Suspension Systems</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Bespoke suspension specification and specialist motorsport engineering products developed around real-world vehicle applications.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Product Intro -->
  <section class="product-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="intro-content">
        <h2>Bespoke <span class="text-green">Suspension & Engineering Solutions</span></h2>

        <p>Too Fast To Race specialises in bespoke Nitron and Penske suspension systems specified around the individual chassis, driver requirements, tyre package and intended vehicle usage. Our approach is consultation-led rather than catalogue-led, focusing on supplying suspension systems that genuinely suit the application.</p>

        <p>Alongside suspension consultancy and chassis development expertise, we also develop and supply specialist engineering components for selected high-performance applications including the Kawasaki Ninja H2 platform. These niche products are developed from genuine motorsport and engineering requirements rather than generic aftermarket trends.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

    <!-- Featured Product -->
  <section class="featured-product">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="product-grid">
        <div class="product-image">
          <div class="image-placeholder">
            <span>H2 Dry Sump Kit</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-content">
          <span class="product-category">Specialist Engineering Product</span>
          <h2>Kawasaki Ninja H2/H2R Dry Sump System</h2>
          <p class="product-lead">Purpose-developed oil control system for extreme track use, motorsport applications and lightweight car conversions.</p>
          
          <p>The Kawasaki Ninja H2 platform presents unique engineering challenges when subjected to sustained high-G loading, slick tyres and prolonged circuit use. In lightweight car conversions particularly, oil surge and crankcase control become critical reliability considerations.</p>

          <p>Developed from real-world engineering requirements, our H2 dry sump system is designed to provide consistent oil control and improved reliability in demanding environments where the standard wet sump arrangement may become compromised.</p>
          
          <div class="product-features">
            <h4>Key Benefits</h4>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Oil Control</strong> – Constant oil supply regardless of G-forces or attitude</li>
              <li><strong>Increased Vacuum</strong> – Reduced windage losses mean more power to the rear wheel</li>
              <li><strong>Reliability</strong> – Eliminates oil starvation risk under extreme conditions</li>
              <li><strong>Flexibility</strong> – External tank can be positioned to suit your installation</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div class="product-specs">
            <h4>Specifications</h4>
            <div class="specs-grid">
              <div class="spec">
                <span class="spec-label">Fitment</span>
                <span class="spec-value">2015-2024 Ninja H2, H2R, H2 Carbon</span>
              </div>
              <div class="spec">
                <span class="spec-label">Pump Type</span>
                <span class="spec-value">3-Stage Scavenge</span>
              </div>
              <div class="spec">
                <span class="spec-label">Application</span>
                <span class="spec-value">Track / Race / Car Conversion</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="product-cta">
            <p>Contact us for pricing and availability. We can advise on installation and tank positioning for your specific application.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Enquire Now</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Other Products -->
  <section class="other-products">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="stripe-accent"></span>
        <h2>Specialist Engineering & Suspension Applications</h2>
        <p>From bespoke suspension specification to specialist motorsport engineering solutions, we support a range of high-performance vehicle applications.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="products-grid">
        <div class="product-card">
          <h3>Nitron Suspension Systems</h3>
          <p>Bespoke Nitron suspension systems specified around the individual vehicle, driver expectations, tyre package and intended use including fast road, track day and Nürburgring applications.</p>
          <a href="/nitron-suspension" class="product-link">Nitron Specification →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="product-card">
          <h3>Penske Racing Shocks</h3>
          <p>Specialist Penske Racing Shocks applications for customers seeking premium-level chassis control, damping consistency and motorsport-focused suspension performance.</p>
          <a href="/penske-racing-shocks" class="product-link">Penske Applications →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="product-card">
          <h3>Track Day Suspension</h3>
          <p>Application-focused suspension specification for track day use, including spring rate philosophy and damping calibration for circuit-focused driving.</p>
          <a href="/track-day-suspension" class="product-link">Track Day Setup →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <h3>Fast Road Suspension</h3>
          <p>Real-world road-focused suspension specification that maintains compliance, ride quality and driver confidence across varied road surfaces.</p>
          <a href="/fast-road-suspension" class="product-link">Fast Road Philosophy →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <h3>Caterham Suspension</h3>
          <p>Specialist Nitron and Penske suspension specification for Caterham Sevens, developed through 30+ years of ownership and racing.</p>
          <a href="/caterham" class="product-link">Caterham Expertise →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <h3>Nitron elec-TRON</h3>
          <p>Active electronic damper systems for BMW, Porsche and other platforms — factory integration with motorsport-grade hardware.</p>
          <a href="/nitron-electron" class="product-link">Active Suspension →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Suspension Philosophy & Engineering -->
  <section class="about-h2">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-content">
          <h2>Suspension Specification & Specialist Engineering</h2>

          <p>Correct suspension specification is about far more than simply choosing a coilover kit from a catalogue. Vehicle weight distribution, chassis characteristics, tyre construction, intended usage and driver expectations all influence how a suspension system should ultimately be specified.</p>

          <p>Too Fast To Race works directly with customers to determine the correct Nitron or Penske suspension platform for the real application — whether that is fast road driving, track day usage, Nürburgring work or dedicated competition use. Where appropriate, systems may also be supplied to bespoke spring and damping specifications developed through years of real-world chassis testing and motorsport experience.</p>

          <p>Alongside suspension consultancy, we also undertake selected specialist engineering projects including the Kawasaki Ninja H2 dry sump system featured above. These projects reflect the broader engineering and vehicle dynamics background behind the suspension development philosophy throughout the site.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-stats">
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="stat-number">30+</span>
            <span class="stat-unit">Years</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Chassis Development Experience</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="stat-number">Nitron</span>
            <span class="stat-unit">& Penske</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Suspension Specialists</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="stat-number">Fast Road</span>
            <span class="stat-unit">Track & Race</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Application Expertise</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Discuss Your Suspension or Engineering Project</h2>
        <p>Whether you need a bespoke Nitron or Penske suspension system, chassis setup guidance or specialist engineering support, we can help specify the correct solution for your vehicle and application.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Discuss Your Project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Page Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding: calc(80px + var(--space-xl)) 0 var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(92, 184, 92, 0.2);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  /* Product Intro */
  .product-intro {
    background: var(--tftr-black);
    padding: var(--space-lg) 0;
  }

  .intro-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .intro-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .intro-content p {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* Featured Product */
  .featured-product {
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
  }

  .product-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .product-image {
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .image-placeholder {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: var(--tftr-dark);
    border: 2px dashed rgba(92, 184, 92, 0.3);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--tftr-grey);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .product-category {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .product-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .product-lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .product-content > p {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .product-features,
  .product-specs {
    background: var(--tftr-dark);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .product-features h4,
  .product-specs h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .product-features ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .product-features li {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .product-features li::before {
    content: '✓';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
  }

  .product-features li strong {
    color: var(--tftr-white);
  }

  .specs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .spec {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .spec-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--tftr-grey);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .spec-value {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--tftr-white);
  }

  .product-cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .product-cta p {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  /* Other Products */
  .other-products {
    background: var(--tftr-black);
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .section-header p {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .products-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .product-card {
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .product-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(92, 184, 92, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .product-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .product-card p {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .product-link {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
  }

  .product-link:hover {
    color: var(--tftr-green-light);
  }

  /* About H2 */
  .about-h2 {
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about-content p {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: var(--tftr-dark);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--tftr-green);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .stat-card .stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-card .stat-unit {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
    margin-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  .stat-card .stat-label {
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--tftr-grey);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  /* CTA Section */
  .cta-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--tftr-green-dark), var(--tftr-green));
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-content h2 {
    color: var(--tftr-black);
  }

  .cta-content p {
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: var(--space-sm) auto var(--space-md);
    max-width: 50ch;
  }

  .cta-content .btn-primary {
    background: var(--tftr-black);
    color: var(--tftr-white);
  }

  .cta-content .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .product-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .product-image {
      position: relative;
      top: 0;
    }

    .specs-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .products-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-stats {
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .stat-card {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 150px;
    }
  }
</style>
